      "leadSummary": "Before naming any mineral, record a specimen code, scale, provenance status, preservation state, and whether the observation came from a single grain or a mixed aggregate. State sample preparation and instrument configuration where relevant. Identify what data would falsify the leading interpretation and whether collec",
